Permissions
  URL: https://v2.tauri.app/security/permissions/
  # Permissions
define them for your own commands.

## Configuration Files
```
tauri-plugin

├── README.md

├── src

│  └── lib.rs

├── build.rs

├── Cargo.toml

├── permissions

│  └── <identifier>.json/toml

│  └── default.json/toml
```

## Examples
```
[[permission]]

identifier = "allow-mkdir"

description = "This enables the mkdir command."

commands.allow = [\
\
    "mkdir"\
\
]
```

Capabilities
  URL: https://v2.tauri.app/security/capabilities/
  # Capabilities
```
fn main() {

    tauri_build::try_build(

        tauri_build::Attributes::new()

            .app_manifest(tauri_build::AppManifest::new().commands(&["your_command"])),

    )

    .unwrap();

}
```

